<node TEXT="第4章 信息安全技术基础知识" ID="ID_2100000000" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>依据《系统架构设计师教程（第2版）》第4章（145-174页）整理：信息安全基础、保障框架、密码与密钥、访问控制、数字签名、抗攻击技术和风险评估。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.1 信息安全基础知识" ID="ID_2100000001" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>信息安全保障信息及其处理、传输、存储和使用过程，核心是保护机密性、完整性、可用性，并使信息流和安全事件可控制、可追查。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.1.1 信息安全的概念" ID="ID_2100000002" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>信息安全包含五个基本要素，保护范围包括设备、数据、内容和行为。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="五个基本要素" ID="ID_2100000003" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>机密性、完整性、可用性、可控性、可审查性。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="机密性" ID="ID_2100000004" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>确保信息不暴露给未授权实体或进程；典型手段是身份认证、访问控制和加密。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="完整性" ID="ID_2100000005" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>只有获准主体才能修改信息，并能发现数据是否被篡改；典型手段是摘要、MAC、数字签名和权限控制。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="可用性" ID="ID_2100000006" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>授权实体需要时能够访问信息和服务；重点防范故障、资源耗尽和拒绝服务攻击。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="可控性" ID="ID_2100000007" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>能够控制授权范围内的信息流向和行为方式，避免信息越权传播或违规使用。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="可审查性" ID="ID_2100000008" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>记录并追踪安全相关行为，为事件调查、责任认定和合规审计提供依据。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="设备安全" ID="ID_2100000009" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>设备是信息系统安全的物质基础。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="稳定性" ID="ID_2100000010" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>设备在一定时间内不发生故障的概率。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="可靠性" ID="ID_2100000011" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>设备在一定时间内正常执行规定任务的概率。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="可用性" ID="ID_2100000012" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>设备处于可正常使用状态的概率；常与维修时间和故障恢复能力相关。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="数据安全" ID="ID_2100000013" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>保护数据免受未授权泄露、篡改和毁坏。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="数据秘密性" ID="ID_2100000014" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>数据不被未授权者知晓。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="数据完整性" ID="ID_2100000015" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>数据正确、真实、完整且未被非法改变。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="数据可用性" ID="ID_2100000016" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>授权者能够按需正常使用数据。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="内容安全" ID="ID_2100000017" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>信息内容满足政治、法律和道德层面的要求，防止违法、有害或违背公共规范的信息传播。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="行为安全" ID="ID_2100000018" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>系统最终通过行为向用户提供服务，应保证行为过程和结果不危害信息安全。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="行为秘密性" ID="ID_2100000019" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>行为过程和结果不泄露需要保护的数据。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="行为完整性" ID="ID_2100000020" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>行为按预期执行，过程和结果不破坏数据完整性。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="行为可控性" ID="ID_2100000021" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>行为偏离预期时能够发现、限制、纠正和恢复。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.1.2 信息存储安全" ID="ID_2100000022" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>覆盖信息使用安全、安全监控、病毒防治、数据加密和防非法攻击等方面。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="用户标识与验证" ID="ID_2100000023" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>访问控制的基础，用于确认访问系统者的身份合法性。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="生物/物理特征" ID="ID_2100000024" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>签名、指纹、语音等；特征不易转移，但需考虑误识率、隐私和模板保护。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="持有物" ID="ID_2100000025" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>智能 IC 卡、磁条卡、令牌等；适合与口令组合形成多因素认证。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="用户存取权限限制" ID="ID_2100000026" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>限制已进入系统的用户能够执行的操作，防止越权和敏感信息泄露。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="隔离控制法" ID="ID_2100000027" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>在数据处理环境周围建立屏障，包括物理隔离、时间隔离、逻辑隔离和密码技术隔离。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="限制权限法" ID="ID_2100000028" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>按用户类别、安全级别和职责授权，对目录、文件、缓冲区和临时数据实施最小权限。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="系统安全监控" ID="ID_2100000029" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>持续监控进程、登录用户、文件权限和变化、安全配置、口令文件、启动文件、可执行文件及特权用户活动。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="日志与审计" ID="ID_2100000030" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>记录身份、时间、对象、动作和结果，支持告警、关联分析和事后追责。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="监控闭环" ID="ID_2100000031" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>发现异常→告警→响应处置→修复漏洞→复盘与规则优化。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="计算机病毒" ID="ID_2100000032" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>具有隐蔽性、传染性、潜伏性、触发性和破坏性。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="技术防护" ID="ID_2100000033" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>安装可信防病毒软件、及时更新病毒库和安全补丁、检测敏感文件、使用防火墙并正确配置系统。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="管理防护" ID="ID_2100000034" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>强口令、不同账号不同口令、重要数据定期备份、谨慎处理邮件附件、重要网络物理隔离。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="恢复准备" ID="ID_2100000035" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>离线/异地备份、恢复演练和应急预案比单纯“查杀”更能降低业务损失。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.1.3 网络安全" ID="ID_2100000036" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>网络开放性、身份隐藏和跨域连接扩大了攻击面，安全工作需要同时处理漏洞、威胁和安全目标。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="网络安全漏洞" ID="ID_2100000037" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>系统弱点可能来自物理接入、特权软件恶意代码、软硬件不兼容组合以及不恰当的安全策略。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="物理安全性漏洞" ID="ID_2100000038" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>非授权设备或人员能够物理接入网络、主机、端口或介质。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="软件安全漏洞" ID="ID_2100000039" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>设计、编码、配置或后门问题可能让攻击者获取额外权限。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="不兼容使用漏洞" ID="ID_2100000040" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>单独安全的软硬件组合后产生新的信任边界、接口或配置缺陷。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="安全策略问题" ID="ID_2100000041" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>技术组件只有在正确策略、配置和启用条件下才能形成有效防护。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="五类网络安全威胁" ID="ID_2100000042" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>非授权访问、信息泄露或丢失、破坏数据完整性、拒绝服务、通过网络传播病毒。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="非授权访问" ID="ID_2100000043" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>假冒、身份攻击、非法进入、合法用户越权等绕过或滥用访问控制的行为。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="信息泄露或丢失" ID="ID_2100000044" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>传输、存储或隐蔽信道造成敏感信息外泄，也可能通过流量、频度和长度分析推断信息。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="破坏数据完整性" ID="ID_2100000045" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>非法删除、修改、插入或重放信息，使系统产生错误或有利于攻击者的响应。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="拒绝服务" ID="ID_2100000046" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>消耗或破坏计算、网络和应用资源，使合法用户无法获得服务。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="网络病毒传播" ID="ID_2100000047" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>借助网络快速扩散恶意代码，影响范围和破坏性通常高于单机感染。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="安全措施的目标" ID="ID_2100000048" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>访问控制、认证、完整性、审计/不可抵赖、保密。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="认证 vs 访问控制" ID="ID_2100000049" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>认证回答“你是谁/是否真实”；访问控制回答“你能做什么”。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="审计与不可抵赖" ID="ID_2100000050" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通过完整、可信记录和签名证据，使交易事后可证实，通信方不能轻易否认。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.2 信息系统安全的作用与意义" ID="ID_2100000051" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>信息安全事关个人权益、企业经营、社会稳定、国家安全和发展；攻击已从窃密、诈骗和破坏数据发展到长期潜伏、供应链渗透和影响物理设施。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="个人与社会层面" ID="ID_2100000052" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>防止隐私泄露、网络诈骗、有害信息传播和公共服务中断，保护财产、人身和社会秩序。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="组织与产业层面" ID="ID_2100000053" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>保护商业秘密、业务连续性、知识产权、品牌信誉和合规状态，避免直接经济损失与连锁风险。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="国家安全层面" ID="ID_2100000054" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>关键信息基础设施、国防、能源、交通、金融等受到攻击时可能造成现实世界的重大后果。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="安全与信息化关系" ID="ID_2100000055" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>安全是信息化持续发展的前提，信息化越深入，组织对信息系统的依赖和潜在损失越高。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="总体思路" ID="ID_2100000056" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>统筹发展与安全，以风险为导向，形成技术、组织和管理协同的纵深防御体系。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.3 信息安全系统的组成框架" ID="ID_2100000057" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>完整的信息安全系统由技术体系、组织机构体系和管理体系共同构建；只有技术而无组织和制度无法长期有效。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.3.1 技术体系" ID="ID_2100000058" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>从基础设备到网络、操作系统、数据库和终端形成多层防护。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="基础安全与物理环境" ID="ID_2100000059" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>密码芯片、加密卡、身份识别卡；机房、建筑、电力、机械防护、电磁干扰和电磁泄漏防护。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="网络安全" ID="ID_2100000060" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>物理隔离、防火墙、访问控制、加密传输、认证、数字签名、摘要、隧道/VPN、病毒防范、上网行为管理和安全审计。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="操作系统安全" ID="ID_2100000061" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>正确配置、及时修补且无后门木马；机制包括标识鉴别、访问控制、最小特权、可信通路、运行保障、存储/文件保护和审计。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="数据库安全" ID="ID_2100000062" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>涵盖 DBMS 和数据库应用；关注物理/逻辑完整性、元素安全、审计、访问控制、认证、可用性、推理控制、多级保护和隐蔽通道。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="终端安全" ID="ID_2100000063" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>保护终端设备、接口、数据和通信；教材举例包括电话、传真和异步数据密码设备。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="纵深防御" ID="ID_2100000064" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>不同层的控制相互补偿：边界失守后仍有身份、主机、数据和审计防线。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.3.2 组织机构体系" ID="ID_2100000065" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>由机构、岗位和人事管理构成组织保障。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="决策层" ID="ID_2100000066" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>确定安全战略、风险偏好、资源投入和重大事件决策。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="管理层" ID="ID_2100000067" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>制定制度和方案，组织风险、合规、运维、审计和应急管理。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="执行层" ID="ID_2100000068" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>落实配置、监控、测试、响应、备份和日常安全操作。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="岗位与职责分离" ID="ID_2100000069" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>按安全事务设置岗位，明确责任边界，对高风险操作实行最小权限、双人复核或相互制约。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="人员全生命周期" ID="ID_2100000070" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>覆盖入职、在职、调岗和离职的教育、考核、授权变更和安全监管。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.3.3 管理体系" ID="ID_2100000071" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>“三分技术，七分管理”强调安全能力依赖持续管理。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="法律管理" ID="ID_2100000072" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>依据国家法律法规规范信息系统主体及其与外界关联的行为。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="制度管理" ID="ID_2100000073" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>根据安全需求建立组织内部规章、流程、标准、责任和监督机制。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="培训管理" ID="ID_2100000074" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>提升人员意识和技能，减少误操作、社会工程和制度执行偏差，是安全落地的前提。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.4 信息加解密技术" ID="ID_2100000075" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>密码技术把明文转换为密文并恢复，主要保护机密性，也可结合摘要、MAC 和签名保障完整性、认证与不可抵赖。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.4.1 数据加密" ID="ID_2100000076" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>密码学包括设计密码体制的密码编码学和研究破译的密码分析学。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="保密通信模型" ID="ID_2100000077" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>发送方计算 C=E(K,P) 得到密文；接收方计算 P=D(K,C) 恢复明文。算法可公开，安全性主要依赖密钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="无条件安全" ID="ID_2100000078" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>即使获得任意数量密文也没有足够信息确定明文；现实系统更多追求计算上安全。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="计算安全" ID="ID_2100000079" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>理论上可能破解，但在给定时间、算力和成本下不可行；密钥长度、算法强度和实现质量共同决定安全性。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Kerckhoffs 思想" ID="ID_2100000080" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>系统不应依赖算法保密，算法公开仍应安全，真正需要保护的是密钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.4.2 对称密钥算法" ID="ID_2100000081" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>加密密钥与解密密钥相同或可直接相互推导；速度快、适合大批量数据，但密钥分配和管理困难。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="DES" ID="ID_2100000082" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>64 位分组、有效密钥 56 位，16 轮核心变换；密钥空间已不足，易受穷举攻击，不宜用于现代新系统。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="3DES" ID="ID_2100000083" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>常用两个密钥执行加密-解密-加密（EDE），有效密钥强度约 112 位；兼容 DES 但速度约慢三倍，现多被 AES 替代。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="IDEA" ID="ID_2100000084" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>128 位密钥、64 位分组、8 轮迭代，可软硬件实现，曾用于多种商业产品。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="AES" ID="ID_2100000085" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>Rijndael 算法，支持 128/192/256 位密钥，软硬件效率高，是现代常用分组密码标准。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="优点" ID="ID_2100000086" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>运算速度快、吞吐高、实现成熟，适合文件、数据库、磁盘和网络流量加密。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="缺点" ID="ID_2100000087" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通信双方必须安全共享密钥；用户规模增长时密钥数量、更新、撤销和泄漏影响难管理。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.4.3 非对称密钥算法" ID="ID_2100000088" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>使用不同的公钥和私钥；公钥可公开，私钥必须保密，难以由公钥推导私钥。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="保密通信" ID="ID_2100000089" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>发送方用接收方公钥加密，只有持有对应私钥的接收方可以解密。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="数字签名" ID="ID_2100000090" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>签名者用私钥产生签名，验证者用公钥验证来源和完整性；实际通常签名消息摘要而非直接“私钥加密全文”。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="RSA" ID="ID_2100000091" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>安全性建立在大整数因数分解困难性上；公钥为(e,n)，私钥为(d,n)，可用于加密、签名和密钥交换相关机制。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="优点" ID="ID_2100000092" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>缓解共享密钥分配问题，支持数字签名、身份认证和不可抵赖。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="缺点" ID="ID_2100000093" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>计算开销大、速度慢，不适合直接加密大量数据；还需 PKI/证书确认公钥归属。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="混合加密（考试归纳）" ID="ID_2100000094" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>非对称算法用于认证和安全分配随机会话密钥，对称算法用该会话密钥加密业务数据，兼顾密钥管理与性能。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="对称与非对称对比" ID="ID_2100000095" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对称：同一密钥、速度快、密钥分配难；非对称：公私钥、速度慢、便于认证和密钥交换；工程中通常混合使用。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.5 密钥管理技术" ID="ID_2100000096" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>密钥管理覆盖产生、分配、存储、使用、轮换、备份、恢复、撤销和销毁；密码算法再强，密钥管理失控仍会导致整体失效。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.5.1 对称密钥的分配与管理" ID="ID_2100000097" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>目标是自动、高效分配密钥并减少系统长期驻留密钥数量。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="密钥使用控制" ID="ID_2100000098" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>限制密钥用途，避免同一密钥被违规用于不同算法、方向或业务。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="密钥标签" ID="ID_2100000099" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>用标签位标识主密钥/会话密钥、加密/解密等用途；实现简单但长度和灵活性有限。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="控制矢量" ID="ID_2100000100" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>用可变长字段描述允许用途，经散列后与主密钥结合生成保护会话密钥的密钥，使密钥与用途绑定。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="四种共享密钥分配方式" ID="ID_2100000101" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>A 物理发送给 B；第三方分别物理发送；用已有共享密钥加密新密钥；通过各自与可信第三方的保密信道分配。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="无中心方式的规模问题" ID="ID_2100000102" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>N 个用户两两通信最多需 N(N-1)/2 个共享密钥，分配、更新和泄漏控制成本高。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="KDC 密钥分配中心" ID="ID_2100000103" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>每个用户仅与 KDC 共享一个主密钥；KDC 为通信双方产生临时会话密钥，通信结束后销毁。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="主密钥" ID="ID_2100000104" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>用户与 KDC 长期共享，用于安全分配会话密钥；N 个用户只需 N 个主密钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="会话密钥" ID="ID_2100000105" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>仅用于一次或一段时间的通信，缩小长期泄漏影响。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="分层 KDC" ID="ID_2100000106" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>小范围设置本地 KDC，再由全局 KDC 连接，减少分发压力并把伪造 KDC 的危害限制在局部。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="有效期权衡" ID="ID_2100000107" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>轮换越频繁通常越安全，但会增加网络负担和通信延迟。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.5.2 公钥体制的密钥管理" ID="ID_2100000108" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>核心问题不是保密公钥，而是可信地确认“公钥属于谁”。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="公开发布" ID="ID_2100000109" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>用户直接广播或附带公钥，简单但任何人可能冒名发布伪造公钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="公用目录表" ID="ID_2100000110" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>可信管理员维护用户名与公钥的动态目录；便于查询和更新，但目录或管理员密钥失陷会影响全局。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="公钥管理机构" ID="ID_2100000111" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>用户每次请求公钥，由管理机构签名应答；控制严密但容易成为性能瓶颈和集中攻击目标。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="公钥证书" ID="ID_2100000112" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>CA 用私钥签发含主体身份、公钥、有效期等信息的证书；接收方用 CA 公钥验证，无需每次在线联系管理机构。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="证书解决的问题" ID="ID_2100000113" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>把身份与公钥可信绑定，防止中间人用自己的公钥冒充他人。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="证书生命周期" ID="ID_2100000114" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>申请、签发、发布、使用、更新、撤销和过期；验证还需检查信任链、有效期和撤销状态。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.5.3 公钥加密分配对称密钥" ID="ID_2100000115" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>双方先可信交换公钥，再通过随机数完成相互认证，用公钥机制保护会话密钥，随后用对称算法进行高效通信。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="随机数/Nonce" ID="ID_2100000116" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>标识一次协议运行，防止旧报文重放并帮助确认响应的新鲜性。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="保密性" ID="ID_2100000117" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>会话密钥用接收方公钥保护，只有接收方私钥可解密。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="认证性" ID="ID_2100000118" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>结合发送方私钥签名或认证信息，证明会话密钥来自预期发送者。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="典型思想" ID="ID_2100000119" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>公钥算法解决认证与密钥分配，对称算法承担后续大数据量加密。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.6 访问控制及数字签名技术" ID="ID_2100000120" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>访问控制约束主体对客体的操作，数字签名证明消息来源和完整性，并支持不可抵赖。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.6.1 访问控制技术" ID="ID_2100000121" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>访问控制由主体、客体和控制策略构成，并通过认证、策略实施和审计形成闭环。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="主体 Subject" ID="ID_2100000122" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>执行访问动作的主动实体，可以是用户、用户组、终端、应用、服务或进程。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="客体 Object" ID="ID_2100000123" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>接受访问的被动实体，可以是文件、记录、数据库、设备、服务或其他信息资源。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="控制策略" ID="ID_2100000124" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>规定主体可对客体执行的操作以及约束条件，例如读、写、执行和管理。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="三个实施环节" ID="ID_2100000125" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>认证确认身份；策略实现执行授权规则；审计记录并监督合法用户或管理员的滥用。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="访问控制矩阵 ACM" ID="ID_2100000126" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>以主体为行、客体为列，单元格记录主体对客体的权限集合；表达直观但大型系统矩阵巨大且稀疏。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="访问控制表 ACL" ID="ID_2100000127" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>按客体保存矩阵的一列，列出哪些主体对该客体有什么权限。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="优点" ID="ID_2100000128" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>便于查询、修改和撤销某客体的授权，是现代系统常见实现。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="缺点" ID="ID_2100000129" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>查询或撤销某主体对所有客体的权限需要遍历大量 ACL。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="能力表 Capabilities" ID="ID_2100000130" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>按主体保存矩阵的一行，列出该主体对各客体的能力。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="优点" ID="ID_2100000131" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>便于查询主体拥有的全部权限。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="缺点" ID="ID_2100000132" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>查询哪些主体能访问某客体较困难，能力本身还需防伪造和转移。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="授权关系表" ID="ID_2100000133" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>每行保存一个非空的主体-客体-权限关系；按主体或客体建立索引可兼顾查询效率，安全数据库常采用。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="易混点" ID="ID_2100000134" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>ACL=按客体/矩阵列；能力表=按主体/矩阵行；授权关系表=保存非空单元关系。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.6.2 数字签名" ID="ID_2100000135" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>使接收者验证消息来源，发送者不能否认发送，接收者或第三方不能在不被发现的情况下篡改或伪造。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="签名条件" ID="ID_2100000136" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>可信、不可伪造、不可重用、签名后文件不可改变、不可抵赖。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="对称密钥签名" ID="ID_2100000137" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通信双方借助共同信任的仲裁者验证和保存证据；依赖在线/可信仲裁者和共享密钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="公开密钥签名" ID="ID_2100000138" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>发送者用私钥对消息摘要签名，接收者用发送者公钥验证；通常结合证书确认公钥身份。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="签名不等于加密" ID="ID_2100000139" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>签名主要解决来源、完整性和不可抵赖，不天然提供机密性；机密性需另行加密。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="典型流程" ID="ID_2100000140" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>计算消息摘要→用私钥产生签名→发送消息和签名→接收方重新计算摘要并用公钥验证。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="时间戳与重放防护" ID="ID_2100000141" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>加入可信时间、序列号或随机数，证明签名产生时间和报文新鲜性。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.7 信息安全的抗攻击技术" ID="ID_2100000142" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>抗攻击不是单点产品，而是强密钥、协议加固、边界防护、监测审计、漏洞治理和应急恢复的组合。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.7.1 密钥的选择" ID="ID_2100000143" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>密钥强度取决于空间大小、弱钥规避和随机性。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="增大密钥空间" ID="ID_2100000144" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>足够的密钥长度提高穷举成本，但也要选择经过验证的算法和参数。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="选择强钥" ID="ID_2100000145" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>避免算法定义的弱钥、重复模式、默认密钥和可预测密钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="密钥随机性" ID="ID_2100000146" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>使用密码学安全随机数发生器，保证不可预测和足够熵；时间戳、用户名等不能直接作为密钥。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.7.2 拒绝服务攻击与防御" ID="ID_2100000147" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>DoS/DDoS 通过资源耗尽、协议缺陷或异常流量破坏可用性。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="传统 DoS" ID="ID_2100000148" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>单一或少量来源利用带宽、连接、CPU、内存、应用线程或协议实现缺陷使服务失效。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="DDoS" ID="ID_2100000149" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>攻击者控制大量分布式主机同时攻击，流量大、来源分散、溯源和封堵困难。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="三级控制结构" ID="ID_2100000150" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>攻击者/Client 发令；主控端 Handler 控制；代理端 Agent/僵尸主机执行实际攻击。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="防御方法" ID="ID_2100000151" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>修补漏洞、识别攻击包特征、监控敏感端口、统计流量异常、限速与连接保护、清洗/高防、弹性扩容和多层告警。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="防御原则" ID="ID_2100000152" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>在网络边界、主机协议栈和应用层分层限流；保留监控证据并准备降级、切换和恢复方案。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.7.3 欺骗攻击与防御" ID="ID_2100000153" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>攻击者伪造地址、身份或响应，使通信方信任错误的对象。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="ARP 欺骗" ID="ID_2100000154" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>利用主机无条件接受 ARP 应答并更新缓存的特点，伪造 IP-MAC 映射，把流量引向攻击者。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="危害" ID="ID_2100000155" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>中间人窃听、篡改、会话劫持或断网。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="防范" ID="ID_2100000156" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>关键映射静态绑定、交换机动态 ARP 检测、DHCP Snooping、双向绑定、网络隔离和异常 ARP 监测。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="DNS 欺骗" ID="ID_2100000157" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>攻击者冒充 DNS 或污染解析结果，把域名指向伪造地址。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="检测：被动监听" ID="ID_2100000158" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>维护请求-应答映射，发现同一请求出现多个矛盾响应。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="检测：虚假报文探测" ID="ID_2100000159" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>向非 DNS 目标发送查询，若仍收到伪造响应则表明可能存在攻击者。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="检测：交叉查询" ID="ID_2100000160" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对返回 IP 做反向或其他可信解析交叉验证。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="防范归纳" ID="ID_2100000161" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>可信递归服务器、DNSSEC、加密 DNS 的可信配置、缓存保护和证书校验。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="IP 欺骗" ID="ID_2100000162" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>伪造源 IP 冒充可信主机，常与 DoS、会话预测或反射攻击结合。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="防范" ID="ID_2100000163" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>入口/出口过滤、反向路径检查、防火墙丢弃“外部进入但源地址为内部”的报文，避免仅按 IP 建立信任。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.7.4 端口扫描" ID="ID_2100000164" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通过探测目标端口响应判断开放服务和操作系统特征，是攻击前信息收集手段。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="端口与 Socket" ID="ID_2100000165" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>IP 地址和端口共同定位主机中的通信端点/进程。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="全 TCP 连接扫描" ID="ID_2100000166" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>完成三次握手，结果可靠但容易被日志记录。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="SYN 半开放扫描" ID="ID_2100000167" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>收到 SYN+ACK 判断端口开放后发送 RST，不完成连接；速度快且比全连接隐蔽。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="FIN 扫描" ID="ID_2100000168" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>向端口发送 FIN，根据关闭端口通常返回 RST、开放端口可能无响应来判断；受协议栈差异影响。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="第三方/代理扫描" ID="ID_2100000169" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>借助被控制的第三方主机扫描，以隐藏真实来源。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="防范" ID="ID_2100000170" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>关闭不必要服务、最小化暴露端口、防火墙白名单、IDS/IPS 识别扫描模式、蜜罐诱捕和审计告警。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.7.5 强化 TCP/IP 堆栈" ID="ID_2100000171" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通过协议栈配置、过滤、限流和更新降低利用协议缺陷发起 DoS 的风险。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="SYN Flood" ID="ID_2100000172" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>大量伪造 SYN 使服务器维护半连接并重传，耗尽连接队列、CPU 和内存。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="防御" ID="ID_2100000173" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>SYN Cookie、缩短超时、扩大/保护队列、限制单源连接速率、反欺骗过滤和上游流量清洗。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="ICMP 攻击" ID="ID_2100000174" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>利用超大、畸形或高频 ICMP 报文消耗资源或触发实现缺陷。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="防御" ID="ID_2100000175" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>补丁更新、合理限速和过滤异常 ICMP；不能一概禁用全部 ICMP，以免影响诊断和路径 MTU 等正常机制。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="SNMP 攻击" ID="ID_2100000176" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>弱口令、默认团体字、开放写权限或错误配置可能泄露信息、改变设备配置或被用于反射放大。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="防御" ID="ID_2100000177" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>优先 SNMPv3、强认证与加密、限制管理源、关闭写权限/无用服务、修改默认凭据并审计访问。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.7.6 系统漏洞扫描" ID="ID_2100000178" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>检查信息系统中可能被利用的漏洞，评估攻击可能性，为修复和安全方案提供依据。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="基于网络的扫描" ID="ID_2100000179" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通过网络构造探测包并分析远程主机响应，无需在目标安装代理。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="组成模块" ID="ID_2100000180" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>漏洞数据库、用户配置控制台、扫描引擎、活动扫描知识库、结果存储和报告工具。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="优点" ID="ID_2100000181" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>部署成本相对低、不需目标管理员参与、不安装代理、网络变化时维护较方便。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="局限" ID="ID_2100000182" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>只能看到网络暴露面，受防火墙和服务响应影响，难检查本地配置、文件和进程细节。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="基于主机的扫描" ID="ID_2100000183" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>在目标安装 Agent/Service，访问本地文件、配置、补丁和进程，因此检查更深入。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="优点" ID="ID_2100000184" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>覆盖漏洞更多、可集中管理、扫描主要在本地完成因而网络流量较小。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="局限" ID="ID_2100000185" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>需要部署和维护代理，依赖目标权限，对主机资源和兼容性有影响。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="扫描后的闭环" ID="ID_2100000186" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>验证结果和去误报→按资产与风险定级→修复/缓解→复测→跟踪例外和残余风险。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="4.8 信息安全的保障体系与评估方法" ID="ID_2100000187" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>通过安全保护等级和风险评估确定保护目标、控制强度及持续改进方向。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="4.8.1 计算机信息系统安全保护等级" ID="ID_2100000188" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>GB 17859—1999 将安全保护能力划分为五级，能力由自主访问控制逐步增强到形式化、结构化和强抗渗透。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="第1级 用户自主保护级" ID="ID_2100000189" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对应 TCSEC C1；隔离用户与数据，提供自主访问控制，使用户保护自身和用户组信息。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="第2级 系统审计保护级" ID="ID_2100000190" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对应 C2；增加细粒度自主访问控制、登录规程、安全事件审计和资源隔离，使用户对自身行为负责。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="第3级 安全标记保护级" ID="ID_2100000191" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对应 B1；在第二级基础上加入安全策略模型、数据标记和主体对客体的强制访问控制。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="第4级 结构化保护级" ID="ID_2100000192" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对应 B2；基于明确定义的形式化安全策略，访问控制覆盖全部主体客体，考虑隐蔽通道，划分关键/非关键保护元素并加强鉴别和配置管理。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="第5级 访问验证保护级" ID="ID_2100000193" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>对应 B3；满足访问监控器要求，仲裁全部访问，监控器抗篡改、足够小且可分析测试；精简非必要代码，增强审计、恢复和抗渗透。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="递进记忆" ID="ID_2100000194" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>自主保护→审计负责→安全标记/强制控制→形式化和结构化→访问监控器与高抗渗透。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="4.8.2 安全风险管理" ID="ID_2100000195" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>风险来自威胁利用脆弱性作用于有价值资产，造成安全事件和业务影响；风险评估是建立保障体系的重要决策机制。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="风险评估准备" ID="ID_2100000196" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>确定范围、明确目标、建立组织结构、选择系统性方法、获得最高管理者批准并传达。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="评估形式" ID="ID_2100000197" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>自评估由系统拥有者组织；他评估由上级或主管机关发起，常具有检查和强制性质；两者均可借助专业服务机构。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="基本要素" ID="ID_2100000198" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>资产、威胁、脆弱性、风险和安全措施；相关属性包括业务战略、资产价值、安全需求、安全事件和残余风险。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="资产" ID="ID_2100000199" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>承载业务价值的信息、系统、应用、网络、设备、人员和服务；业务越依赖，资产安全价值通常越高。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="威胁" ID="ID_2100000200" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>可能对资产造成破坏的因素或事件，分人为有意、无意和环境因素；一项资产可面临多个威胁。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="脆弱性" ID="ID_2100000201" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>资产或控制中的弱点，本身不直接造成损失，但可能被威胁利用。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="安全措施" ID="ID_2100000202" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>抗击威胁、降低脆弱性、减少事件可能性或影响，但需要成本且可能无效或实施不当。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="残余风险" ID="ID_2100000203" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>实施控制后仍存在的风险；可能来自控制不足，也可能是权衡成本与资产价值后主动接受，需持续监视。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="要素关系" ID="ID_2100000204" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>业务依赖资产→资产价值导出安全需求；脆弱性暴露资产→威胁利用脆弱性形成风险→风险可能演变为事件；措施满足需求并降低风险，但留下残余风险。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="资产识别与赋值" ID="ID_2100000205" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>按信息系统和业务分类资产，依据保密性、完整性、可用性损失造成的业务影响赋值，而不是仅看账面价格。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="影响分析" ID="ID_2100000206" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>考虑违法违规、业务中断、声誉损失、隐私侵犯、人身伤害、商业秘密泄露、经济损失和公共安全危害等。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="威胁识别" ID="ID_2100000207" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>结合资产环境、历史事件和攻击趋势识别威胁来源、方式、频率和可能性。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="脆弱性评估" ID="ID_2100000208" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true" FOLDED="false"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>从物理、网络、系统、应用和管理层检查技术与管理弱点。</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="方法" ID="ID_2100000209" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>问卷调查、人员访谈、工具扫描、手动检查、文档审查和渗透测试。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="注意点" ID="ID_2100000210" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>无对应威胁的弱点可暂不控制但必须记录；错误或无效的安全措施本身也可能成为脆弱性。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="风险计算过程" ID="ID_2100000211" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>识别并赋值资产→分析威胁及可能性→识别脆弱性并评估严重性→计算安全事件可能性→结合资产重要性计算风险值。</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="风险处置" ID="ID_2100000212" CREATED="1787124382563" MODIFIED="1787124382563" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS" CONTENT-TYPE="plain/auto"><html><head></head><body><p>可选择降低、规避、转移或接受；处置后复评残余风险并进入持续监控。</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node></node>
<node TEXT="第5章 软件工程基础知识" POSITION="top_or_left" ID="ID_1406198623" CREATED="1786959461122" MODIFIED="1786959461125" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      依据《系统架构设计师教程（第2版）》第 5 章（175-217 页）整理：软件过程、需求工程、系统分析设计、测试、净室、构件工程和项目管理。
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
<edge COLOR="#0000ff"/>
<node TEXT="5.1 软件工程" ID="ID_1348205020" CREATED="1786959461224" MODIFIED="1786959461224" AI_EDITS="true"><richcontent TYPE="DETAILS">
<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      软件工程用系统化、严格约束、可量化的工程方法开发、运行和维护软件，目标是提高质量、控制成本、降低风险。
    </p>
  </body>
